{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:0.1"], "en": "The Therāpadāna:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:0.2"], "en": "The Chapter on the Throwing of the Lotus (Padumukkhipavagga) 6.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:0.3"], "en": "The Apadāna of the Elder Macchadāyaka (The Fish-Giver)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:1.1", "PA_tha-ap_268:1.2"], "en": "“At that time, I was a heron dwelling on the bank of the Candabhāgā River;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:1.3"], "en": "having seized a large fish, I— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:1.4"], "en": "I gave it to the Siddhattha Sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:2.1", "PA_tha-ap_268:2.2"], "en": "That fish which I gave back then, ninety-four aeons ago;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:2.3"], "en": "I do not know a state of woe;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:2.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of giving fish.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:3.1"], "en": "The four analytical knowledges—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:3.2"], "en": "\"...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:3.3"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:4.1"], "en": "Thus indeed did the venerable elder Macchadāyaka speak these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_268:5.1"], "en": "The legend of the Elder Macchadāyaka is the sixth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"}
]
